      "kind": "field",
      "status": "mapped",
      "destination": "/monster/behavior/attacks/0",
      "resolution": "src/creatures/monsters/monsters.cpp deserializeSpell sets COMBAT_PARAM_BLOCKARMOR and COMBAT_PARAM_BLOCKSHIELD on a monster melee, so its damage is reduced by the target armor and shield defense (mitigated_by). Melee chance normalized to 100: monsters.cpp deserializeSpell: melee is scheduled by interval; the declared chance is not applied."
    },
