      "source_field": "attacks[2]",
      "kind": "field",
      "status": "unresolved_semantics",
      "resolution": "combat entry with type None: a missing or undefined constant leaves Canary MonsterSpell.combatType at COMBAT_UNDEFINEDDAMAGE, which has no authoring damage type. The reference-date wiki lists no ability to decide the element (owner decision D25)."
